fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/gstanalyticssegmentationmtd.html#GstAnalyticsSegmentationMtd","fragment":"\n\tGstAnalyticsSegmentationMtd\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstAnalytics.SegmentationMtd\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstAnalytics.SegmentationMtd\n\nMembers\nHandle containing data required to use gst_analytics_segmentation_mtd APIs.\nThis type is generally expected to be allocated on the stack.\nInstance identifier\nInstance of GstAnalyticsRelationMeta where the analytics-metadata\nidentified by id is stored.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nHandle containing data required to use gst_analytics_segmentation_mtd APIs.\nThis type is generally expected to be allocated on the stack.\nInstance identifier\nInstance of GstAnalytics.RelationMeta where the analytics-metadata\nidentified by id is stored.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nHandle containing data required to use gst_analytics_segmentation_mtd APIs.\nThis type is generally expected to be allocated on the stack.\nInstance identifier\nInstance of GstAnalytics.RelationMeta where the analytics-metadata\nidentified by id is stored.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});